      "en": "None of his sins that he has committed will be remembered against him. He has done that which is lawful and right. He will surely live.",
      "ko": "그의 본래 범한 모든 죄가 기억되지 아니하리니 그가 정녕 살리라 이는 법과 의를 행하였음이니라 하라",
      "source_text_hash": "5663d52fc317e4191bfe96d05082a518185e30f3f97f9d9012d3b0f52f3e913d",
      "translation_text_hash": "70c5c21d432ed825416859eacc383082291391fec69cc8f95c721d45d72641d3",
